WChain API_CryptHash implementation layout
==========================================

This directory follows the structure requested by the CryptHash submission
template.

Reference_Implementation/
  WChain-V1-512/
  WChain-V2-1024/

Optimized_Implementation/
  WChain-V1-512/
  WChain-V2-1024/

Each instance directory contains:

  CryptHash_AlgorithmInstance.h
      Instance name, digest length, and the CryptHash prototype.

  CryptHash_AlgorithmInstance.c
      Thin API adapter. It calls the WChain C implementation in the same
      AlgorithmInstance directory through wchain_crypt_hash_c().

  wchain_c.c, wchain_c.h
      WChain reference/optimized implementation core used by the API adapter.

  KAT_CryptHash.c, drng.c, drng.h
      Unmodified files copied from API_CryptHash.zip.

  build_kat.sh
      Linux/GCC build script for the official KAT generator.

Reference builds define WCHAIN_DISABLE_SIMD and use ISO C99 scalar code.
Optimized builds use the same public CryptHash API and enable native compiler
optimization flags.
